      <marc:subfield code="a">&quot;Owen and Luke Wilson always wanted to act and make movies. After dropping out of college, the Wilsons teamed up with Wes Anderson to act, direct, and produce the independent film &apos;Bottle rocket&apos;. Since then, the careers of the Wilson brothers have soared like rockets - the two stars have appeared in more than 60 movies between them. Luke Wilson has become one of Hollywood&apos;s most sought after romatnic leads while Owen Wilson has made his mark as a comedic actor in buddy films like &apos;Shanghai Noon&apos; and &apos;Wedding Crashers&apos;. Owen is also an accomplished screenwriter, having received an Oscar nomination for his script for the comedy &apos;The Royal Tenenbaums&apos;.&quot; - back cover</marc:subfield>
